stateDiagram-v2
  state "閲覧" as viewing
  state "編集" as editing
  state "復習" as reviewing
  state "削除確認" as deleting
  state "エラー" as error

  [*] --> viewing: 取得成功
  [*] --> error: 取得失敗

  viewing --> error: API エラー
  editing --> error: 保存失敗
  reviewing --> error: 更新失敗
  deleting --> error: 削除失敗

  error --> viewing: 再取得
